      "receiptSource": "Original Receipt from \u003Ci\u003EA New System Of Domestic Cookery\u003C/i\u003E By \u0027A Lady\u0027 (Mrs. Maria Eliza Ketelby Rundell) (\u003Ca href=\u0022references.html#rundell-1807\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003ERundell 1807\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E)",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ERESPECTING THE POOR\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nA very good meal may be bestowed in a thing called Brewis, which is thus made: cut a very thick upper crust of bread and put it into the pot, Have salt beef boiling and near ready; it will attract some of the fat, and, when swelled out, will be no unpalatable dish to those who rarely taste meat.\u003Cbr\u003E"
